{"type":"standard","title":"William Timmons","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">William Timmons</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q28837296","titles":{"canonical":"William_Timmons","normalized":"William Timmons","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">William Timmons</span></span>"},"pageid":53300717,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/William_Timmons%2C_official_portrait%2C_116th_Congress.jpg/330px-William_Timmons%2C_official_portrait%2C_116th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/William_Timmons%2C_official_portrait%2C_116th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1372346053","tid":"fe0e8b15-a523-11f1-8b70-af22f0888a15","timestamp":"2026-08-31T10:09:03Z","description":"American politician (born 1984)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Timmons","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Timmons?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Timmons?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:William_Timmons"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Timmons","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/William_Timmons","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Timmons?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:William_Timmons"}},"extract":"William Richardson Timmons IV is an American politician, prosecutor, and Air Force officer serving as the U.S. representative for South Carolina's 4th congressional district since 2019. His district is in the heart of the Upstate and includes Greenville, Spartanburg, and most of their suburbs. Previously, Timmons served as a South Carolina state senator from 2016 to 2018. He is a member of the Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>William Richardson Timmons IV</b> is an American politician, prosecutor, and Air Force officer serving as the U.S. representative for South Carolina's 4th congressional district since 2019. His district is in the heart of the Upstate and includes Greenville, Spartanburg, and most of their suburbs. Previously, Timmons served as a South Carolina state senator from 2016 to 2018. He is a member of the Republican Party.</p>"}